@startuml
title Order — xử lý sau khi sẵn sàng
[*] --> PENDING : sandbox đã trả / COD consume xong
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Seller/Owner xác nhận
CONFIRMED --> PROCESSING : bắt đầu xử lý
PROCESSING --> SHIPPED : giao mô phỏng
SHIPPED --> COMPLETED : sandbox giao / COD thu đủ Order
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Customer/Seller/Owner hủy
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : Customer/Seller/Owner hủy
@enduml
